   "Cyclical sectors are expected to continue leading, with broadening internal participation away from narrow leadership.",
   "Defense sector risk-reward is turning more attractive after a year of underperformance, with a preference for 'new capabilities' (drones, electronic warfare) over legacy platforms.",
