   "Investors should shift from fixed asset class bucket allocation to scenario-based portfolio construction to better manage risk.",
   "In the event of an AI-driven market slowdown, these previously diversified buckets would likely experience a correlated drawdown.",
   "UBS recommends prioritizing quality companies with differentiated market positioning and quantitative strategies that can compound independently of AI evolution.",
   "Portfolio construction should focus on balance-sheet optimization, allowing for dynamic shifts between liquid equities and private credit without being constrained by artificial asset class limits."
